L65: Figure 7 Salivary lipid peroxidation (TBARS) after 30 min of cycle ergometer exercise. (a) Acute supplementation. (b) AUC of acute supplementation. (c) Five days of supplementation. (d) AUC of 5 days of supplementation.  ∗ Statistical difference from the PL session ( P  < 0.05).
